Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:30:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Stylus: optional drag-to-scroll (arrow keys), e.g. HoMM3
 adventure map

New setting 'Stylus drag': left button drag (default) | scroll map with
arrow keys | scroll map inverted. In scroll mode a pen drag beyond the touch
slop sends one arrow key tap per 32 px (one HoMM3 tile) in grab-and-drag
direction; the cursor stays where the pen landed so edge scrolling does not
kick in. Short tap = LMB click, long press = RMB as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
